"Spec revision (2026-08-09, user): identities are per-connection/device, so roles must NOT attach to identities. This task now layers on accounts-layer-with-confirmed-multi-device-login (do that first): the roles table stays, but the relation becomes ACCOUNT-roles (not identity-roles); claim_admin_role(secret_token) grants the admin role to the calling identity's ACCOUNT (identity resolved through account_identities); privileged reducers (push_assets, GM ops) resolve caller identity -> account -> role. Everything else stands: token injected via the publish action, init() stops auto-pushing, e2e seeding claims the role (which now also means the harness creates/attaches an account first)."